<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective April 26.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     24.85     24.28	  3.87-9.11  4.16-9.39</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     24.85     24.28	  3.70-8.68  3.97-8.96</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     25.70     27.60	 12.42	11.43</p>
<p> White sugar	  25.70     27.60	  7.86	 6.91</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.26	0.28	  0.39	 0.37</p>
</text>
